==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Plus One: Special}}

==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Welcome to the "new" Otherworld Colosseum, where the rule is yet another beneficial one for you: any Special units are duplicated, basically giving them twice their normal damage. Unlike its brother Plus One: Uber, where each stage was filled with chaos to compensate, this Colosseum is fairly easy overall.

This stage in particular is a Red/Black stage, with Mooths spawning occasionally to annoy you. Unforuntely for this stage, [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] targets both traits, and as such completely obliterates this entire stage. Pair in some Research combos and meatshields for the Capy and you should win fairly easily. Even if you don't have Dark Lazar's Talents for whatever reason, you can spam [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for the J.J.Jackrabbits and Capy, use [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] to wall the Reds and use a suitable anti-Dark for the Dark Otters, and it should be fairly straightforward to beat the stage before Bun Bun Black spawns.

